/P 83 0 R
/E (CSECcon is a cybersecurity conference run by UTS:CSEC. The conference will have a series of presentations alongside a live CTF for attendees to participate in.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
140 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 83 0 R
/E (CSEC genuinely cares for the development of all our members and the wider community. After noticing a gap between academia and industry, as well as cybersecurity conferences in Sydney at large, we have decided to find a solution to this growing problem. CSECcon allows students to expand their horizons and be  provided with a platform where they can connect with and learn from many different industry professionals in one space. This year marks the fifth time we are running CSECcon. We are committed to fostering an environment where industry has the chance to meet with the future generation of cyber security professionals. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
