142 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 83 0 R
/E (CSECcon is an information security conference run by community members for community members. CSECcon is aimed primarily at tertiary students, however, we welcome academics and professionals within the cybersecurity industry. Speakers are encouraged to deliver industry-relevant presentations on a range of cybersecurity topics. If you are reading this, CSECcon is for you! )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
